{"ID":"20240205164743-b73n9sw","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205164743-b73n9sw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205164743-b73n9sw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205172443-1o34l4n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607111048-bprauoh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3067,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240618164447-9xby74j\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:5,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:5\u0026#125;","title":"043巴戟天","type":"doc","updated":"20240805130323"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205172443-1o34l4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172443-1o34l4n","updated":"20240205172556"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、广西、福建、海南等地。\n【性状】\t根扁圆柱形式圆柱形，略弯曲，长度不等，直径12cm，表面灰黄色或灰黄棕色，有的微带紫色，具纵皱及深陷的横纹，有的呈缢缩状或皮部横向断离而露出木部，形如鸡肠。质坚韧，折断面不平，皮部厚57mm，淡紫色，木部直径2"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBackslashContent","Data":"~"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4mm。气微，味苦，略涩。\n【品质】\t以条肥壮、连珠状、肉厚、色紫者为佳。\n【性味】\t辛、甘，温。\n【功效】\t补肾助阳；强筋壮骨；祛风除湿。用于肾虚阳痿；遗精早泄；少腹冷痛；小便不禁；宫冷不孕；风寒湿痹；腰膝酸软；风湿肢气。\n【炙品】\t炙巴戟：取甘草，捣碎，置锅内加水煎汤，捞去甘草渣，加入拣净的巴戟天，煮至松软能抽出木心时 (此时余汤不宜多)，取出，趁热抽去木心，晒干。 (每100斤巴戟天，用甘草6斤4两)\n盐巴戟：取拣净的巴戟天，用盐水拌匀，入笼蒸透，抽去木心，晒干。 (每100斤巴戟天，用盐2斤，加适量开水化开澄清) 。"}]},{"ID":"20240205172448-uj651s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205172448-uj651s7","updated":"20240205172448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240205172448-y0mt9ri.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165441-rykd22y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165441-rykd22y","updated":"20240205165441"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天-20240205165441-xs38ybr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​​"}]},{"ID":"20240618164235-hzk3e5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240618164235-hzk3e5t","updated":"20240805115419"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天-20240805115417-a3lripj.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805123523-zjhr32h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805123523-zjhr32h","updated":"20240805125002"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 287px;","style":"width: 277px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (6)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 6-20240805115939-t041qra.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 277px;\" parent-style=\"width: 287px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 639px;","style":"width: 629px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (9)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 9-20240805124133-3jijfdc.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 629px;\" parent-style=\"width: 639px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 365px;","style":"width: 355px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240805123850-c3uqpv2.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 355px;\" parent-style=\"width: 365px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805125004-ffahpdy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805125004-ffahpdy","updated":"20240805130151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 410px;","style":"width: 400px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (11)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 11-20240805124948-vbdsodw.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 400px;\" parent-style=\"width: 410px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (13)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 13-20240805125833-s0k5xol.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805130143-0h2e241","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805130143-0h2e241","updated":"20240805130143"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 604px;","style":"width: 594px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (3)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 3-20240805115610-37p3ef8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 594px;\" parent-style=\"width: 604px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 603px;","style":"width: 593px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 1-20240805115501-25jypa8.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 593px;\" parent-style=\"width: 603px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805115939-e6osygq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805115939-e6osygq","updated":"20240805130317"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 254px;","style":"width: 244px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (10)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 10-20240805124748-ikn6vvz.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 244px;\" parent-style=\"width: 254px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 289px;","style":"width: 279px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (7)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 7-20240805123517-c0uij8r.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 279px;\" parent-style=\"width: 289px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 754px;","style":"width: 744px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (12)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 12-20240805125724-p7i79wh.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 744px;\" parent-style=\"width: 754px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805130323-g311scc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805130323-g311scc","updated":"20240805130323"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 566px;","style":"width: 556px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 4-20240805115659-5ats10l.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 556px;\" parent-style=\"width: 566px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (5)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 5-20240805115740-egj0wq0.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805130124-6qnmxmr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805130124-6qnmxmr","updated":"20240805130124"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"巴戟天 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/巴戟天 14-20240805130124-msvveo4.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240805125059-62q1lc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240805125059-62q1lc8","updated":"20240805125122"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"注：巴戟天叶面粗糙，有一个个像是鸡皮一样的小疙瘩；"}]},{"ID":"20240616105509-7kb51ku","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105509-7kb51ku"}},{"ID":"20240616105828-15r0drn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105828-15r0drn","updated":"20240616105831"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105828-axk7mzk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105828-axk7mzk","updated":"20240616105828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105828-k1e1ohq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105828-k1e1ohq","updated":"20240616105828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志，益气。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105828-qpmtt82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105828-qpmtt82","updated":"20240616105828"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生巴郡及下邳，二月八月，采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105845-4x89fmu","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105845-4x89fmu"}},{"ID":"20240616105846-qh5h4d9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105846-qh5h4d9","updated":"20240616105850"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105846-vkedtxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105846-vkedtxt","updated":"20240616105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘，无毒．主治头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精，利男子．生巴郡及下邳．二月、八月采根，阴干．（复盆子为之使．恶朝生、雷丸、丹参．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616105846-tpft7nc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105846-tpft7nc","updated":"20240616105846"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶巴戟天，味辛，微温．主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中增志益气．生山谷．"}]},{"ID":"20240616110007-mt5wenf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110007-mt5wenf"}},{"ID":"20240616110008-9sqx9h2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110008-9sqx9h2","updated":"20240616110012"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110008-u4c01s8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110008-u4c01s8","updated":"20240616110008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（以连珠多肉浓者为胜．用枸杞子煎汤浸一宿．漉出．再酒浸一伏时．漉出．同菊花熬煎黄．去菊花．以布拭干用．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616110008-4rd0sxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110008-4rd0sxu","updated":"20240616110008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240616110008-syuyrb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110008-syuyrb1","updated":"20240616110008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛甘微温无毒．"}]},{"ID":"20240616110008-tghjnkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110008-tghjnkp","updated":"20240616110008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240616110008-1vnt34i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110008-1vnt34i","updated":"20240616110008"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大风邪气．阴痿不起．强筋骨．安五脏．疗头面游风．小腹及阴中相引痛．乃肾经血分药也．"}]},{"ID":"20240616110047-144afk1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110047-144afk1"}},{"ID":"20240616110048-igvzdh9","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110048-igvzdh9","updated":"20240616110053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110048-ejr9ik5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110048-ejr9ik5","updated":"20240616110048"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能入肾肝血分．起痿强阳．质属甘苦辛温．益阴固下．疝瘕香港脚．借以温通．痹湿风寒．资其宣导．（巴戟天其根状如牡丹．而结细过之．外赤内黑．去心用．专治肝肾阳虚．补而不滞．宣而不燥．故凡一切风寒湿痹于下焦腰膝诸证．皆可治之．其气味甘温之中．略兼辛苦．色紫质重．其功可想．观巴戟之用．为下焦肝肾血分之药．能补阴中之阳．若阴中真水不足而相火旺者不宜用．以其味兼辛苦气温．非纯静之药耳．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616110059-8z9o18o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110059-8z9o18o"}},{"ID":"20240616110100-3hgyfkm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110100-3hgyfkm","updated":"20240616110106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110100-isowiz9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110100-isowiz9","updated":"20240616110100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，微温，无毒。主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志，益气，疗头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精，利男子。生巴郡及下邳山谷。二月、八月采根，阴干。（覆盆子为之使，恶朝生、雷丸、丹参。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616110100-7fa7gax","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110100-7fa7gax","updated":"20240616110100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶今亦用建平、宜都者，状如牡丹而细，外赤内黑，用之打去心。唐本注云∶巴戟天苗，俗方名三蔓草。叶以茗，经冬不枯，根如连珠，多者良，宿根青色，嫩根白紫，用之亦同。连珠肉浓者为胜。臣禹锡等谨按药性论云∶巴戟天，使。能治男子夜梦，鬼交泄精，强阴，除头面中风，主下气，大风血癞。病患虚损，加而用之。日华子云∶味苦。安五脏，定心气，除一切风，治邪气，疗水肿。又名不凋草，色紫如小念珠，有小孔子，坚硬难捣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110100-nvntrmw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110100-nvntrmw","updated":"20240616110100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶巴戟天，生巴郡及下邳山谷，今江淮、河东州郡亦有之，皆不及蜀州者佳。叶似茗经冬不枯，俗名三蔓草，又名不凋草。多生竹林内。内地生者，叶似麦门冬而浓大，至秋结实。二月、八月采根，阴干，今多焙之。有宿根者青色，嫩根者白色，用之皆同，以连珠肉浓者胜。今方家多以紫色为良。蜀人云∶都无紫色者。彼方人采得，或用黑豆同煮，欲其色紫，此殊失气味，尤宜辨之。一说蜀中又有一种山律根，正似巴戟，但色白。土人采得，以醋水煮之乃紫，以杂巴戟，莫能辨也。真巴戟，嫩者亦白，干时亦煮治使紫，力劣弱，不可用。今两种，市中皆是。但击破视之，其中而紫鲜洁者，伪也。真者击破，其中虽紫，又有微白惨如粉色，理小暗也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110100-huifs76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110100-huifs76","updated":"20240616110100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公曰∶凡使，须用枸杞子汤浸一宿，待稍软漉出，却用酒浸一伏时，又漉出，用菊花同熬令焦黄，去菊花，用布拭令干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110100-js4ozs7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110100-js4ozs7","updated":"20240616110100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶巴戟天，本有心，干缩时，偶自落，或可以抽摘，故中心或空，非自有小孔子也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110100-bkmgc4q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110100-bkmgc4q","updated":"20240616110100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今人欲要中间紫色，则多伪以大豆汁沃之，不可不察。外坚难染，故先从中间紫色。有人嗜酒，日须五、七杯。后患香港脚甚危，或教以巴戟半两，糯米同炒，米微转色，不用米，大黄一两，锉、炒，同为末，熟蜜为丸，温水服五、七十丸，仍禁酒，遂愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110110-l6zaydg","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110110-l6zaydg"}},{"ID":"20240616110111-01oog4v","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110111-01oog4v","updated":"20240616110117"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草撮要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110111-yjo672n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110111-yjo672n","updated":"20240616110111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛．入足少阴经．功专温补元阳．得纯阴药有既济之功．并散风湿．治风气脚气水肿．去心酒浸焙用．覆盆子为使．恶丹参．"}]},{"ID":"20240616110036-u92wlhr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616110036-u92wlhr"}},{"ID":"20240616110037-jtnd22u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616110037-jtnd22u","updated":"20240616110041"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616110037-k7jzglz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110037-k7jzglz","updated":"20240616110037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治。补虚劳。益精气。去风。补血。为肾脏病脚肿之主药。"}]},{"ID":"20240616110037-837yj6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616110037-837yj6p","updated":"20240616110037"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟丸。巴戟（去心）白术五味子茴香（炒）熟地苁蓉（酒浸）人参覆盆子菟丝子（酒浸）牡蛎益智仁骨碎补（洗去毛）白龙骨各等分。研末蜜丸梧子大。每服三十丸。食前米饮下。日二三次。能戢阳止汗。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105958-2tcpmn6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105958-2tcpmn6"}},{"ID":"20240616105959-g0n4o0n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105959-g0n4o0n","updated":"20240616110003"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105959-nwnggkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105959-nwnggkc","updated":"20240616105959"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天本有心，干缩时偶自落，或可以抽摘，故中心或空，非自有小孔子也。今人欲要中间紫色，则多伪，以大豆汁沃之，不可不察。外坚难染，故先从中间紫色。有人嗜酒，日须五七杯，后患香港脚甚危，或教以巴戟半两，糯米同炒，米微转色，不用米，大黄一两，锉、炒，同为末，熟蜜为丸，温水服五七十丸，仍禁酒，遂愈。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105944-023m337","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105944-023m337"}},{"ID":"20240616105945-wgl9bm7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105945-wgl9bm7","updated":"20240616105952"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105945-q3112of","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105945-q3112of","updated":"20240616105945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"覆盆子为之使。恶雷丸、丹参、朝生。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105945-mjc677i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105945-mjc677i","updated":"20240616105945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛、甘，温。入足少阴经血分。助阳起阴。治一切风湿水肿，少腹引阴冷痛，夜寐梦交精泄。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105945-zvks0lu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105945-zvks0lu","updated":"20240616105945"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"得纯阴药，有既济之功。君大黄，治饮酒香港脚。滚水浸去心。助阳，杞子煎汁浸蒸。去风湿，好酒拌炒。摄精，金樱子汁拌炒。理肾气，菊花同煮。火旺泄精，阴水虚乏，小便不利，口舌干燥，四者禁用。巴戟、锁阳，暖肾经之寒。熟地、杞子，制肾脏之热。肾脏虚多热，肾经虚多寒，经脏不同，水火判别，毋得误用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105936-6yx1lc5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105936-6yx1lc5"}},{"ID":"20240616105937-4lb7qn5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105937-4lb7qn5","updated":"20240616105940"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《冯氏锦囊秘录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105937-4vlijsa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105937-4vlijsa","updated":"20240616105937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"禀土得真阳之精气，兼得天之阳和，阳主发散，散则横行，是当木之令，而兼金之用也，故味辛、甘，微温，无毒。水泡去心用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105937-1ttl6uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105937-1ttl6uh","updated":"20240616105937"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天，禁梦遗精滑，虚损劳伤，头面游风，及大风当浸淫血癞，主阴痿不起及小腹牵引绞疼，安五脏，健骨强筋，定心气，利水消肿，益精增志，惟利男人，温补肾脏虚寒之要药。惟相火炽者，勿用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105923-84th5i7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105923-84th5i7"}},{"ID":"20240616105924-8r1gge3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105924-8r1gge3","updated":"20240616105928"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105924-13cyewl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105924-13cyewl","updated":"20240616105924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补肾祛风．"}]},{"ID":"20240616105924-p21y445","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105924-p21y445","updated":"20240616105924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘辛微温．入肾经血分．强阴益精．治五劳七伤．散风湿．治风气香港脚水肿．阴虚而相火炽真也．蜀产佳．（山 根似巴戟、但色白、人或醋煮以乱之．）去心．酒浸焙用．覆盆子为使．恶丹参．"}]},{"ID":"20240616105914-b0q0dcz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105914-b0q0dcz"}},{"ID":"20240616105915-fzzmc72","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105915-fzzmc72","updated":"20240616105919"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105915-gfi84d7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105915-gfi84d7","updated":"20240616105915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名不凋草、三蔓草。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105915-fl8kkb5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105915-fl8kkb5","updated":"20240616105915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」（根）辛、甘、微温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105915-4lnfqna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105915-4lnfqna","updated":"20240616105915"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」风湿、脚气、肾虚、阳痿。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105905-e906gj3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105905-e906gj3"}},{"ID":"20240616105906-k46n2nb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105906-k46n2nb","updated":"20240616105910"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《神农本草经读》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105906-dsj4b9r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105906-dsj4b9r","updated":"20240616105906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘、微温，无毒。主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中增志益气。（酒焙。）陈修园曰∶巴戟天气微温，禀天春升之木气而入足厥阴肝；味辛甘无毒，得地金土二味入足阳明燥金胃。虽气味有木土之分，而其用则统归于温肝之内。《佛经》以风轮主持大地，即是此义。《本经》以“主大风”三字提纲两见∶一见于巴戟天，一见于防风。阴阳造化之机，一言逗出。《金匮》云∶“风能生万物，亦能害万物。”防风主除风之害，巴戟天主得风之益，不得滑口读去。盖人居大块之中，乘气以行，鼻息呼吸不能顷刻去风。风即是气，风气通于肝，和风生人，疾风杀人。其主大风者，谓其能化疾风为和风也。邪气者，五行正气不得风而失其和。木无风则无以遂其条达之情，火无风则无以遂炎上之性，金无风则无以成其坚劲之体，水无风则潮不上，土无风则植不蕃。一得巴戟天之用，则到处皆春而邪气去矣。邪气去而五脏安，自不待言也。况肝之为言敢也，肝阳之气，行于宗筋而阴痿起；行于肾脏，肾存志而志增，肾主骨而骨强；行于脾脏，则震坤合德，土木不害而中可补。益气二即风也，逐而散之；风散则为气散，生而亦死；益而和之，气和即为风和，死可回生。非明于生杀消长之道者，不可以语此也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105906-ug68ifz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105906-ug68ifz","updated":"20240616105906"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶天士云∶淫羊藿治阴虚阴痿，巴戟天治阳虚阴痿。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105855-pf7bsdf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105855-pf7bsdf"}},{"ID":"20240616105856-zvextvg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105856-zvextvg","updated":"20240616105900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105856-2hulatf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105856-2hulatf","updated":"20240616105856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补肾，祛风"}]},{"ID":"20240616105856-rdwtohb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105856-rdwtohb","updated":"20240616105856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘辛微温。入肾经血分、强阴益精，治五劳七伤；辛温散风湿，治风气、香港脚、水肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105856-iyoa349","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105856-iyoa349","updated":"20240616105856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"根如连珠。击破中紫而鲜洁者，伪也。中虽紫，微有白糁粉色而理小暗者，真也。蜀产佳（山 根似巴戟，但色白，人或醋煮以乱之）。去心，酒浸焙用。复盆子为使。恶丹参。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105836-p1ouetf","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105836-p1ouetf"}},{"ID":"20240616105837-u9mq3c1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105837-u9mq3c1","updated":"20240616105840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105837-2lro05n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105837-2lro05n","updated":"20240616105837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味辛甘，微温，无毒。主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志，益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105837-8ys3f7v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105837-8ys3f7v","updated":"20240616105837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（巴戟天一名不凋草，始出巴郡及下邳山谷，今江淮河东州郡亦有，然不及川蜀者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105837-rg2f6bz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105837-rg2f6bz","updated":"20240616105837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"叶似巴戟生于巴蜀，气味辛甘，禀太阴金土之气化。其性微温，经冬不凋，又禀太阳标阳之气化。主治大风邪气者，得太阴之金气，金能制风也。治阴痿不起，强筋骨者，得太阳之标阳，阳能益阴也。安五脏，补中者，得太阴之土气，土气盛，则安五脏而补中。增志者，肾藏志而属水，太阳天气，下连于水也。益气者，肺主气而属金，太阴天气，外合于肺也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105509-qfsj1b5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105509-qfsj1b5"}},{"ID":"20240616105817-hnvmcj1","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105817-hnvmcj1","updated":"20240616105822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草经解》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105817-uxrv0sv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105817-uxrv0sv","updated":"20240616105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气微温．味辛甘．无毒．主大风邪气．阴痿不起．强筋骨．安五脏补中．增志益气．（酒焙）"}]},{"ID":"20240616105817-mfi7uzs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105817-mfi7uzs","updated":"20240616105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天气微温．禀天春升之木气．入足厥阴肝经．味辛甘无毒．得地金土二味．入足阳明燥金胃经．气味俱升．阳也．风气通肝．巴戟入肝．辛甘发散．主大风邪气．散而泻之也．阴者宗筋也．宗筋属肝．痿而不起．则肝已全无鼓动之阳矣．巴戟气温益阳．所以主之．盖巴戟治阳虚之痿．淫羊藿治阴虚之痿也．肝主筋．肾主骨．辛温益肝肾．故能强筋骨也．胃者五脏之原．十二经之长．辛甘入胃．温助胃阳．则五脏皆安也．胃为中央土．土温则中自补矣．肾统气而藏志．巴戟气温益肝．肝者敢也．肝气不馁．则不耗肾．而志气增益也．"}]},{"ID":"20240616105817-i2mpcvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105817-i2mpcvu","updated":"20240616105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【制方】"}]},{"ID":"20240616105817-auvqshr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105817-auvqshr","updated":"20240616105817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天同五味、苁蓉、山茱萸、鹿茸、柏仁、杞子、补骨脂．治阴痿．同鹿角、柏仁、天冬、远志、莲须、覆盆、黄柏．治夜梦鬼交泄精．同熟大黄．治饮酒人脚 ．"}]},{"ID":"20240616105722-4thee4x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105722-4thee4x"}},{"ID":"20240616105755-dbghajr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105755-dbghajr","updated":"20240616105759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105755-9u7hb4y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105755-9u7hb4y","updated":"20240616105755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，微温，入足少阴肾、足厥阴肝经。强筋健骨，秘精壮阳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105755-yssksmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105755-yssksmo","updated":"20240616105755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天温补精血，滋益宗筋，治阳痿精滑，鬼交梦遗。驱逐脉风，消除痂癞。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105755-69fi3rv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105755-69fi3rv","updated":"20240616105755"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"去梗，酒浸，蒸晒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105722-xyiudv0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105722-xyiudv0"}},{"ID":"20240616105747-c70bt8n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105747-c70bt8n","updated":"20240616105751"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105747-pno4zro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105747-pno4zro","updated":"20240616105747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛甘，微温，无毒。主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志，益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105747-g0qlb39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105747-g0qlb39","updated":"20240616105747"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精，利男子。生巴郡及下邳山谷，二月八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105723-hng0n91","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105723-hng0n91"}},{"ID":"20240616105739-8bw9t92","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105739-8bw9t92","updated":"20240616105742"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105739-v9oqba9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105739-v9oqba9","updated":"20240616105739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（山草）温补肾阴兼祛风湿"}]},{"ID":"20240616105739-1neq2lk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105739-1neq2lk","updated":"20240616105739"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天（专入肾）。辛甘微温。据书称为补肾要剂。能治五痨七伤。强阴益精。以其体润故耳。（好古曰。巴戟肾经血分药也。权曰。病患虚损。加而用之。）然气味辛温。又能祛风除湿。故凡腰膝疼痛。风气香港脚水肿等症。服之更为有益。（宗 曰。有人嗜酒。日须五七杯。后患香港脚甚危。或教以巴戟半两。糯米同炒。米微转色。去米不用。大黄一两。锉炒。同为末。熟蜜丸。温水服。仍禁酒愈。）观守真地黄饮子用此以治风邪。义实基此。未可专作补阴论也。川产中虽色紫微有白糁粉色。而理小暗者真。（根如连珠。击破中紫而鲜洁者伪。又山 根似巴戟。但色白。人多以醋煮乱之。）去心。酒浸焙用。覆盆子为使。恶丹参。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105723-zyjgwr9","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105723-zyjgwr9"}},{"ID":"20240616105724-r1u11xd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105724-r1u11xd","updated":"20240616105733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105724-nyni2ky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105724-nyni2ky","updated":"20240616105724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，微温，无毒。主治大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志，益气。治头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精，利男子。生巴郡及下邳山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105724-reefgfy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105724-reefgfy","updated":"20240616105724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"二月、八月采根，阴干。（覆盆子为之使，恶朝生、雷丸、丹参。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616105724-s842tpk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105724-s842tpk","updated":"20240616105724"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"今亦用建平、宜都者，状如牡丹而细，外赤内黑，用之打去心。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105509-tr43un6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105509-tr43un6"}},{"ID":"20240616105712-bjzroqe","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105712-bjzroqe","updated":"20240616105716"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105712-8sel4vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105712-8sel4vd","updated":"20240616105712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天，味甘、温，无毒。入心、肾二经。补虚损劳伤，壮阳道，止小腹牵痛，健骨强筋，定心气，益精增志，能止梦遗，此臣药，男妇俱有益，不只利男人也。世人谓其能使痿阳重起，故云只利男子。不知阳事之痿者，由于命门火衷，妇人命门与男子相同，安在不可同补乎。（〔批〕巴戟天男女受益，论是。）夫命门火衰，则脾胃寒虚，即不能大进饮食。用附子、肉桂，以温命门，未免过于太热，何如用巴戟天之甘温，补其火，而又不烁其水之为妙耶。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105712-tjdw35k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105712-tjdw35k","updated":"20240616105712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问巴戟天近人罕用，止用之于丸散之中，不识亦可用于汤剂中耶？曰∶巴戟天，正汤剂之妙药，无如近人不识也。巴戟天，温而不热，健脾开胃，既益元阳，复填阴水，真接续之利器，有近效，而又有远功。夫巴戟天虽入心、肾，而不入脾、胃，然入心，则必生脾胃之气，故脾胃受其益。汤剂用之，其效易速，必开胃气，多能加餐，及至多餐，而脾乃善消。又因肾气之补，薰蒸脾胃之气也，谁谓巴戟天不宜入于汤剂哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105712-xacl5kf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105712-xacl5kf","updated":"20240616105712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天温补命门，又大补肾水，实资生之妙药。单用一味为丸，更能补精种子，世人未知也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105712-9qlq41m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105712-9qlq41m","updated":"20240616105712"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或疑巴戟天入汤剂最妙，何以前人未见用之？曰∶前人多用，子未知之耳。夫巴戟天，补水火之不足，益心肾之有余，实补药之翘楚也。用之补气之中，可以健脾以开胃气；用之补血之中，可以润肝以养肺阴。古人不特用之，且重用之。自黄柏、知母之论兴，遂置巴戟天于无用之地。嗟乎！人生于火，而不生于寒，如巴戟天之药，又乌可不亟为表扬哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105509-jvtdg2x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105509-jvtdg2x"}},{"ID":"20240616105656-nzoyeta","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105656-nzoyeta","updated":"20240616105700"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105656-cptwfrj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105656-cptwfrj","updated":"20240616105656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛甘。性微温。无毒。禀土德真阳之气。兼得天之阳和以生。可升可降。阳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105656-t5gqxu4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105656-t5gqxu4","updated":"20240616105656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"覆盆子为使。恶雷丸、丹参。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105656-a3e5ow9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105656-a3e5ow9","updated":"20240616105656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主大风邪气。阴痿不起。强筋骨。安五脏。补中。增智。益气。（本经）疗头面游风气。治【归经】入肾经。为强阴益精之品。（肾经血分药补助元阳祛风除湿）【前论】仲淳曰。五脏之劳。肾为之主。下气则火降。火降则水升。阴阳互宅。精神内守。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105656-3pvwvh5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105656-3pvwvh5","updated":"20240616105656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"元阳【禁忌】经疏曰。凡相火炽。思欲不得。便赤口苦。目昏目痛。烦躁口渴。大便燥结者。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105656-dj1rs7k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105656-dj1rs7k","updated":"20240616105656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"均【炮制】雷公曰。凡使。先用杞子汤浸一宿。待软。酒浸一伏时漉出。同菊花炒焦黄。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105509-7727xf5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105509-7727xf5"}},{"ID":"20240616105647-wqtjmwq","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105647-wqtjmwq","updated":"20240616105651"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本草蒙筌》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105647-rr8fcwu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105647-rr8fcwu","updated":"20240616105647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，气微温。无毒。江淮虽有，巴蜀独优。多生深谷茂林，叶浓凌冬不瘁。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105647-5w9tahs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105647-5w9tahs","updated":"20240616105647"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"故俗名二蔓草，又名不凋草也。凡入药剂，采根阴干。宿根色青，嫩根色白。用之功相若，但选肉浓连珠。根原有心，干缩自落。人或抽摘，中亦空虚，非自有小孔耳。（未去尽者，亦宜抽之。）即今方家，惟以中间紫色者为良。（据蜀人云∶都无紫色，咸系染成。）或用黑豆，煮汁沃之。（亦或同煮过。）紫虽做成，气味殊失。或又采山 根，染紫假充，（蜀中一种山根，形亦相类，但色白，用醋煮之乃紫，多采充卖，莫能辨认。）俱不可不细察也。（击破视之，其中紫而鲜洁者为真，真者中虽紫，又有微白掺如粉色，理小暗也。）制须酒浸，过宿曝干。恶丹参雷丸，宜覆盆为使。禁梦遗精滑，补虚损劳伤。治头面游风，及大风浸淫血癞；主阳痿不起，并小腹牵引绞疼。安五脏健骨强筋，安心气利水消肿。益精增志，惟利男人。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105509-0isp26g","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105509-0isp26g"}},{"ID":"20240616105638-pof4npa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105638-pof4npa","updated":"20240616105642"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105638-iojwmgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105638-iojwmgx","updated":"20240616105638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛、甘，微温，无毒。主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志，益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105638-m34hom0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105638-m34hom0","updated":"20240616105638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"疗头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精，利男子。生巴郡及下邳山谷。二月、八月采根，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105638-xahwwii","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105638-xahwwii","updated":"20240616105638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"覆盆子为之使，恶朝生、雷丸、丹参。 今亦用建平、宜都者，状如牡丹而细，外赤内黑，用之打去心。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105638-whpk6rj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105638-whpk6rj","updated":"20240616105638"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕巴戟天苗，俗方名三蔓草。叶似茗，经冬不枯，根如连珠，多者良，宿根青色，嫩根白紫，用之亦同。连珠肉浓者为胜。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105509-lo31tmq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105509-lo31tmq"}},{"ID":"20240616105630-3q9aeiv","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105630-3q9aeiv","updated":"20240616105635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105630-n9zgub5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105630-n9zgub5","updated":"20240616105630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛微温。主大风邪气。阴痿不起。强筋骨。安五脏。补中增志益气。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105630-2vjdyz1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105630-2vjdyz1","updated":"20240616105630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"森森戟列。巴峡蜀天。连珠的。三蔓葱芊。秋风敛实。冬日扬鲜。山着白。假紫夤缘。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105630-m7r32c7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105630-m7r32c7","updated":"20240616105630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"李白诗。列戟何森森。沈期诗。西南出巴峡。杜甫诗。蜀天常夜雨。苏恭曰。根如连珠。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105630-wxfo4v0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105630-wxfo4v0","updated":"20240616105630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"俗名三蔓草。经冬不枯。司马相如传。的江靡。颜延之诗。积翠亦葱芊。苏颂曰。至秋结实。潘尼赋。收华敛实。顾恺之赋。含馨扬鲜。苏颂曰。山根色白。土人以醋煮之色紫。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105630-03jsuxs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105630-03jsuxs","updated":"20240616105630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"杂巴戟。唐书传。李泌着白者。山人也。唐书纪。假紫及绯。孟浩然诗。沙岸晓夤缘。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105510-fdgtase","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105510-fdgtase"}},{"ID":"20240616105621-7yl4fvw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105621-7yl4fvw","updated":"20240616105626"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105621-9ckaj35","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105621-9ckaj35","updated":"20240616105621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"辛甘微温，无毒。酒浸去心，焙用。川产者良。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105621-rf5auil","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105621-rf5auil","updated":"20240616105621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志，益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105621-1psaw76","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105621-1psaw76","updated":"20240616105621"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天严冬不凋，肾经血分及冲脉药也。故守真地黄饮子用之，即《本经》治大风邪气之谓，以其性补元阳而兼散邪，真元得补，邪安所留，是以可愈大风邪气也。主阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中、增志、益气者，脾胃二经得所养，而诸虚自瘥矣。又治香港脚，补血海，病患虚寒加用之。有人嗜酒患香港脚甚危，或教以巴戟半两、糯米同炒，去米，大黄一两炒为末，熟蜜丸，温水下七十丸，仍禁酒遂愈。惟阴虚相火炽盛者禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105510-14edtiz","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616105510-14edtiz"}},{"ID":"20240616105610-tj4z09f","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105610-tj4z09f","updated":"20240616105616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105610-6o64cha","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105610-6o64cha","updated":"20240616105610"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味辛甘，微温，无毒。主大风邪气，阴痿不去，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增气益志，疗头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精，利男子。《药性论》云∶使。治夜梦鬼交泄精，强阴。日华子云∶味苦。安五脏，定心气，除一切风，治邪气，疗水肿盆子为使。恶∶朝生、雷丸、丹参。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111045-jcvr5aw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607111045-jcvr5aw"}},{"ID":"20240616105504-0aq3oar","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-0aq3oar","updated":"20240616105507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-j2c7yee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-j2c7yee","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【科属与药用部分】本品为茜草科植物巴戟天的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-2m0vsnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-2m0vsnf","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】辛、甘，微温。入肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-aatbp86","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-aatbp86","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】补肾助阳，散风袪寒湿。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-hn6ysdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-hn6ysdc","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于肾虚阳痿，遗精早泄，腰膝痿软等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-p4ot2tu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-p4ot2tu","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"巴戟天温而不燥，补而不滞，能补肾阳、强筋骨。用于阳痿遗泄，常与肉苁蓉、菟丝子等同用；治疗腰膝痿软，常与续断、杜仲等药配伍应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-434h78w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-434h78w","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于下肢寒湿痹痛等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-639zkl4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-639zkl4","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品能助肾阳、散寒湿，治痹痛，用治上述症候，常与附子、狗脊等配合应用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-sjwzv1d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-sjwzv1d","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】巴戟天、巴戟肉（洗净，晒干，切片用。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-7s5yr3p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-7s5yr3p","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】三钱至五钱，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-12k63wl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-12k63wl","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【按语】巴戟天温肾助阳而强筋骨，虽其味辛而兼温，可散风袪寒湿，但其性柔润而不燥，故在临床上不用于一般风湿痛，惟肾阳虚而下肢寒湿痹痛者，始考虑应用。如属湿热下注、足膝红肿热痛等症，忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-sniqco8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-sniqco8","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】巴戟丸《医学发明》：巴戟天、五味子、人参、熟地、肉从蓉、骨碎补、龙骨。治肝肾虚，腰痛、滑精。"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-j3u7ium","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-j3u7ium","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主大风邪气，阳痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中，增志益气。」"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-1bfya50","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-1bfya50","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草纲目》：「治脚气，去风疾，补血海。」"}]},{"ID":"20240616105504-e2t6kd7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616105504-e2t6kd7","updated":"20240616105504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本草备要》：「补肾益精，治五劳七伤，辛温散风湿，治风气脚气水肿。」"}]},{"ID":"20240607111045-rkikfcy","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607111045-rkikfcy"}},{"ID":"20240607111046-7ufd0a4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-7ufd0a4","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：巴戟天"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-uhwl4uw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-uhwl4uw","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-wwlyi5m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-wwlyi5m","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bā Jǐ Tiān"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-wkzlie9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-wkzlie9","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-izsd18s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-izsd18s","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 鸡肠风、鸡眼藤、黑藤钻、兔仔肠、三角藤、糠藤"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-52b16yr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-52b16yr","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-swzz0g9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-swzz0g9","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" RADIX MORINDAE OFFICINALIS"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-3axalj0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-3axalj0","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ze2ws03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ze2ws03","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为茜草科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"巴戟天"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Morinda officinalis How 的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"干燥根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。全年均可采挖，洗净，除去须根，晒至六、七成干，轻轻捶扁，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-3tbk8nh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-3tbk8nh","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-hhdnzmz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-hhdnzmz","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为扁圆柱形，略弯曲，长短不等，直径0.5～2cm。表面灰黄色或暗灰色，具纵纹及横裂纹，有的皮部横向断离露出木部；质韧，断面皮部厚，紫色或淡紫色，易与木部剥离；木部坚硬，黄棕色或黄白色，直径1～5mm。无臭，味甘而微涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-03l5s8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-03l5s8b","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-k2k94vr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-k2k94vr","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防霉，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-g4iamxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-g4iamxl","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-5qxky7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-5qxky7a","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"巴戟肉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"：取净巴戟天，照蒸法（附录Ⅱ D）蒸透，趁热除去木心，切段，干燥。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"盐巴戟天："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取净巴戟天，照盐蒸法（附录Ⅱ D）蒸透，趁热除去木心，切段，干燥。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"制巴戟天："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"取甘草，捣碎，加水煎汤，去渣，加入净巴戟天拌匀，照煮法（附录ⅡD ）煮透，趁热除去木心，切段，干燥。每100kg巴戟天，用甘草6kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-r29uhnd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-r29uhnd","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-3u8eb5t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-3u8eb5t","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品横切面：木栓层为数列细胞。皮层外侧石细胞单个或数个成群，断续排列成环；薄壁细胞含有草酸钙针晶束，切向排列。韧皮部宽广，内侧薄壁细胞含草酸钙针晶束，轴向排列。形成层明显。木质部导管单个散在或 2～3 个相聚，呈放射状排列，直径至 105μｍ；木纤维较发达；木射线宽 1～3 列细胞；偶见非木化的木薄壁细胞群。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-j17usoz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-j17usoz","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"粉末淡紫色或紫褐色。石细胞淡黄色，类圆形、类方形、类长方形、长条形或不规则形，有的一端尖，直径21～96μｍ，壁厚至 39 μｍ，有的层纹明显，纹孔及孔沟明显，有的石细胞形大，壁稍厚。草酸钙针晶多成束存在于薄壁细胞中，针晶长至 184 μｍ。具缘纹孔导管淡黄色，直径至 105μｍ，具缘纹孔细密。纤维管胞长梭形，具缘纹孔较大，纹孔口斜缝状或相交成人字形、十字形。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-w00vch8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-w00vch8","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ecji3v1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ecji3v1","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肾、肝经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-wzepjj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-wzepjj6","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-335i3nt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-335i3nt","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘，辛，微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-exzbmjh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-exzbmjh","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-uprn6fq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-uprn6fq","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾阳，强筋骨，祛风湿。用于阳痿遗精，宫冷不孕，月经不调，少腹冷痛，风湿痹痛，筋骨痿软。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-9ohvjf0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-9ohvjf0","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-42b6ll9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-42b6ll9","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 3～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-l53be5h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-l53be5h","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-c09rzbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-c09rzbj","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-39e4hyj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-39e4hyj","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：巴戟天"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-wwewks4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-wwewks4","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-q0gkcxd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-q0gkcxd","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bā Jǐ Tiān"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-7tzuhm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-7tzuhm2","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-7hwlzga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-7hwlzga","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 巴戟（《本草图经》），鸡肠风（《中药志》），兔子肠（《中药材手册》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-gk3ik71","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-gk3ik71","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-mdyzli1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-mdyzli1","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-hi5387i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-hi5387i","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-dgfksg7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-dgfksg7","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为茜草科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"巴戟天"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"根"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。冬、春季采挖，洗净泥土，除去须根，晒至6～7成干，用木糙轻轻捶扁，晒干；或先蒸过，晒至半干后，捶扁，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-tjtsezt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-tjtsezt","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-mkmfuyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-mkmfuyb","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 野生于山谷、溪边或山林下，亦有栽培。分布广东、广西、福建等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-sano73r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-sano73r","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-6xoj572","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-6xoj572","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 巴戟天，又名：三蔓草（《唐本草》），不雕草（《日华子本草》），鸡眼藤、黑藤钻、糠藤、三角藤。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-yhcusou","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-yhcusou","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缠绕或攀缘藤本。根茎肉质肥厚，圆柱形，支根多少呈念珠状，鲜时外皮白色，干时暗褐色。有蜿蜒状条纹，断面呈紫红色。茎圆柱状，有纵条棱，小枝幼时有褐色粗毛，老时毛脱落后表面粗糙。叶对生，长椭圆形，长3～13厘米，宽1.5～5厘米，先端短渐尖，基部楔形或阔楔形，全缘，下面沿中脉上被短粗毛，叶缘常有稀疏的短睫毛；叶柄有褐色粗毛；托叶鞘状。花序头状，花2～10朵，生于小枝顶端，罕为腋生；花萼倒圆锥状，长3～4毫米，先端有不规则的齿裂或近平截；花冠肉质白色，花冠管的喉部收缩，内面密生短毛，通常4深裂；雄蕊4枚，花丝极短；子房下位，4室，花柱2深裂。浆果近球形，直径5～9毫米，成熟后红色，顶端有宿存的筒状萼管。花期4～5月。果期9～10月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-rxey3vd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-rxey3vd","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-0zbmmrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-0zbmmrs","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 干燥的根呈弯曲扁圆柱形或圆柱形，长度不等，直径约1～2厘米。表面灰黄色。有粗而不深的纵皱纹及深陷的横纹，甚至皮部断裂而露出木部，形成长约1～3厘米的节，形如鸡肠，故土名\"鸡肠风\"。折断面不平，横切面多裂纹；皮部呈鲜明的淡紫色，木郎黄棕色，皮部宽度为木部的两倍。气无，味甜而略涩。以条大、肥壮、连珠状、肉厚、色紫者为佳。条细瘦、肉薄、色灰者质次。 主产广东、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-96ppuml","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-96ppuml","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-3f2k3xa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-3f2k3xa","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 根含蒽醌、黄酮类化合物。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-5d7g3ib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-5d7g3ib","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-9jrzjnu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-9jrzjnu","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 巴戟天：拣去杂质，用热水泡透后，趁热抽去木心，切段，晒干。炙巴戟：取甘草，捣碎，置锅内加水煎汤，捞去甘草渣，加入拣净的巴戟天，煮至松软能抽出木心时（此时余汤不宜多），取出，趁热抽去木心，晒干。（每巴戟天100斤，用甘草6斤4两）盐巴戟：取拣净的巴戟天，用盐水拌匀，入笼蒸透，抽去木心，晒干。（每巴戟天100斤，用盐2斤，加适量开水化开澄清）"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-c789mni","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-c789mni","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡使巴戟天，须用枸杞子汤浸一宿，待稍软漉出，却用酒浸一伏时又漉出，用菊花同熬令焦黄，去菊花，布拭令干用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ddde94d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ddde94d","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《纲目》：\"以酒浸一宿，判焙入药，若急用，只以温水浸软去心用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-k12b2yg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-k12b2yg","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-n42jy1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-n42jy1x","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肝、肾经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-71lgksk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-71lgksk","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《雷公炮制药性解》：\"入脾、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-yngug7n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-yngug7n","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草新编》：\"入心、肾二经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-gc0idfc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-gc0idfc","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草经解》：\"入足厥阴肝经、足阳明胃经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-x87w45a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-x87w45a","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-z94eawk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-z94eawk","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛甘，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-sxygisj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-sxygisj","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味辛，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-j0kxksj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-j0kxksj","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"甘，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-0af07wa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-0af07wa","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《日华子本草》：\"味苦。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-v5i7b0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-v5i7b0i","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-svijdub","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-svijdub","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴虚火旺者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-1laxz1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-1laxz1i","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经集注》：\"覆盆子为之使。恶朝生、雷丸、丹参。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-i7mjw6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-i7mjw6r","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"凡病相火炽盛，便赤，口苦，目赤目痛，烦躁口渴，大便燥秘，法咸忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-186le2e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-186le2e","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《得配本草》：\"火旺泄精，阴虚水乏，小便不利，口舌干燥，四者禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-eglfyxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-eglfyxv","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-9shaoga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-9shaoga","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾阳，壮筋骨，祛风湿。治阳痿，少腹冷痛，小便不禁，子宫虚冷，风寒湿痹，腰膝酸痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-vlhvm2m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-vlhvm2m","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中增志益气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-4xj5079","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-4xj5079","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"疗头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-52y25cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-52y25cl","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"治男子梦交泄精，强阴，除头面中风，主下气，大风血癞。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-q6feecm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-q6feecm","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"安五脏，定心气，除一切风。疗水肿。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-pgtf2vt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-pgtf2vt","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《纲目》：\"治脚气，去风疾，补血海。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-y5xwua0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-y5xwua0","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥《本草求原》：\"化痰，治嗽喘，眩晕，泄泻，食少。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-zc23jbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-zc23jbk","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦广州部队《常用中草药手册》：\"补肾壮阳，强筋骨，祛风湿。治肾虚腰脚无力，痿痹瘫痪，风湿骨痛，神经衰弱，阳萎遗精，早泄，失眠；妇女不育。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-o61tf45","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-o61tf45","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-sedvo2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-sedvo2j","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：熬汤，1.5～3钱；入丸、散、浸酒或熬膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-8dsf37x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-8dsf37x","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-99azyod","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-99azyod","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治虚羸阳道不举，五劳七伤百病。能食，下气：巴戟天、生牛膝各三斤。以酒五斗浸之，去滓温服，常令酒气相及，勿至醉吐。（《千金方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-55h2jae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-55h2jae","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治妇人子宫久冷，月脉不调，或多或少，赤白带下：巴戟三两，良姜六两，紫金藤十六两，青盐二两，肉桂（去粗皮）、吴茱萸各四两。上为末，酒糊为丸。每服二十丸，暖盐酒送下，盐汤亦得。日午、夜卧各一服。（《局方》巴戟丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-dnsrb26","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-dnsrb26","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治风冷腰胯疼痛，行步不得：巴戟一两半，牛膝三两（去苗），羌活一两半，桂心一两半，五茄皮一两半，杜仲二两（去粗皮，炙微黄，判），干姜一两半（炮裂，判）。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和捣三、二百杵，丸如梧桐子大。每于食前，以温酒饮下三十丸。（《圣惠方》巴戟丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-tsb2i98","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-tsb2i98","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治小便不禁：益智仁、巴戟天（去心，二味以青盐、酒煮），桑螵蛸、兔丝子（酒蒸）各等分。为细末，酒煮糊为丸，如梧桐子大。每服二十丸，食前用盐酒或盐汤送下。（《奇效良方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-cauct7t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-cauct7t","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治白浊：菟丝子（酒煮一日，焙干）、巴戟（去心，酒浸煮），破故纸（炒）、鹿茸、山药、赤石脂、五味于各一两。上为末，酒糊丸。空心盐汤下。（《普济方》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-cj4v4yc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-cj4v4yc","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-esh0ky5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-esh0ky5","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-rr5hakz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-rr5hakz","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：巴戟天"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-jg3c8h2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-jg3c8h2","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-62hkt0f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-62hkt0f","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Bā Jǐ Tiān"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-iayag7p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-iayag7p","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-0p8ewqf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-0p8ewqf","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 巴戟、巴吉天、戟天、巴戟肉、鸡肠风、猫肠筋、兔儿肠"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-cpb7ekr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-cpb7ekr","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-dgr4ea3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-dgr4ea3","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ba Ji Tian， Bajitian， Indianmulberry (root)， Medicinal indian mulberry， Medicinal Indianmulberry Root， Medicinal Indionmulberry Root， morinda (root)， Morinda officinalis， Morinda Root， Morindae Radix，"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-pkdvins","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-pkdvins","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-gudieqa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-gudieqa","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-liqpd9t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-liqpd9t","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-l8z5auv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-l8z5auv","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为双子叶植物药茜草科植物巴戟天的根。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-sbnkk64","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-sbnkk64","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Morinda officinalis How"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-9oxa607","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-9oxa607","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：栽种6-7年即可采收。在秋冬季采挖，挖出后，摘下肉质根，洗去泥沙，在阳光下晒至五六成干，用水棒轻轻打扁，再晒至全干即成。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-2dpqqis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-2dpqqis","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-c5yf9m2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-c5yf9m2","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于山谷溪边、山地疏林下或栽培。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-mldt9nd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-mldt9nd","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于福建、酒杯、广东、海南、广西等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-hcb64pr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-hcb64pr","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-4cevzyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-4cevzyr","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 藤状灌木。根肉质肥厚，圆柱形，不规则地断续膨大，呈念珠状。茎有细纵条棱，幼时被褐色粗毛。叶对生；叶柄长4-8mm，有褐色粗毛；叶片长椭圆形，长3-13cm，宽1.5-5cm，先端短渐尖，基部钝或圆形，全缘，上面深绿色，嫩时常带眦色，并有衡疏短粗毛；老时肖滑无毛，下面沿中脉上被短粗毛，叶缘有短睫毛，侧脉6-7对；托叶膜质，鞘状。花序头状，有花2-10朵，生于小枝的顶端或热电厂成伞形花序；总花梗长3-10mm，被污黄色短粗毛；花萼倒圆锥状，先端有不规则的齿裂；花冠白色，肉质，长可达7mm，花冠管的喉部收缩，内面密生短粗毛，多数3深裂，较少14裂；雄蕊与花裂片同数。生于花冠管的近基部，花丝短；子房下位，4室，花柱纤细，2深裂，藏于花冠内。核果近球形，直径6-11mm，熟时红色。小核内有种子4颗，近卵形或倒卵形，背部隆起，侧面平坦，被白短柔毛。花期4-7月，果期。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-x7tdfzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-x7tdfzr","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-gcngdcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-gcngdcm","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.气候土壤：喜温暖的气候，宜阳光充足，以排水良好、土质疏松、富含腐殖质多的砂质壤土或黄壤土为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-rgj94k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-rgj94k2","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.整地：广东地区，于秋季先将山坡的灌木连根挖出，就地烧成草木灰，然后深翻土地约27-33cm。至翌春种植前再耕耙1次，并作成宽0.7-1m的梯田，按株距67cm，挖15cm深的穴，以备种植。广西则于种植前将灌木进行疏伐，并去除枯枝，在林内局部垦地挖穴种植。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-gekh3lc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-gekh3lc","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.种植：3.1.扦插法：广东地区于清明至谷雨间(广西则在12月间)种植。选择2-3年的粗壮藤茎，除去过嫩过老的部分，再剪成长约25cm的插穗。每枝插穗须有3-4个节(两端并须有节)。扦插深度约15cm，每穴插2-3枝，插后覆以细土，踏实，浇水。此法5-10年才可收获，所以广东地区多于巴戟两旁间种木薯、花生、生姜等作物。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-lubguoc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-lubguoc","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.2.根头繁殖法：采挖巴戟时，利用原苗的根头部(带有残根和部分藤茎)种植于整好的地上。此法4-5年即可收获。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-9stec1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-9stec1i","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.田间管理种植巴戟一般较粗放，管理多结合间种作物进行。每年松土、除草、培土1-2次，施肥1次，并须禁止放牧，防止牲畜为害。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-haswow8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-haswow8","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-gnso2wh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-gnso2wh","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 根扁圆柱形式圆柱形，略弯曲，长度不等，直径1-2cm，表面灰黄色或灰黄棕色，有的微带紫色，具纵皱及深陷的横纹，有的呈缢缩状或皮部横向断离而露出木部，形如鸡肠。质坚韧，折断面不平，皮部厚5-7mm，淡紫色，木部直径2-4mm。气微，味苦，略涩。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-7t51zb7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-7t51zb7","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别：1.木栓层为数列，栓内层细胞有的含草酸钙针晶束。中柱鞘部位石细胞断续排列成环，石细胞长方形或类方形，切向直径50-180μm，径向直径30-50μm。韧皮部较宽，近形成层处草酸钙针晶较多。形成层环明显。木质部导管单个散在，偶2-3个成群，切身 直径约至70μm；木纤维发达；偶有非木化木薄壁细胞；木射线宽1-2列细胞。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-m6n2lls","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-m6n2lls","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"品质标志 《中华人民共和国药典》1995年版规定：用冷浸法测定本品水溶性浸出物含量海里少于50.5%。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-h8uuznw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-h8uuznw","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"毒性"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-i7mo27v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-i7mo27v","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 巴戟天水煎液用药浓度250g/kg体重时，未见动物死亡，对大肠杆菌SOS应答系统无明显影响，提示巴戟天可能无诱变或致诱变的遗传作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-rvidewz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-rvidewz","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-tn0jduj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-tn0jduj","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 根含蒽醌类成分：甲基异茜草素(rubiadin)、甲基异茜草素-1-甲醚(rubiadin-1-methyl ether),大黄素甲醚(physcion)，2-羟基羟甲基蒽醌(2-hydroxy-3-hydrox-ymethylanthraquinone)，1-羟基蒽醌(1-hydroxyanthraquinone)，1-羟基-2-甲基蒽醌(1-hydroxy-2-methyl anthraquinone)，1，6-二羟基-2，4-二甲氧基蒽醌(1，6-dihydroxy-2,4-dimethoxyan-thraquinone)，1，6-二羟基-2-甲氧基蒽醌(1,6-dihydroxy-2-methoxyanthraquinone)，2-甲基蒽醌(2-methylanthraqui-none)，还含环烯醚萜成分；水晶兰甙(monoTCMLIBopein)，四乙酰车叶草甙(asperuloside teTCMLIBaacetate)。又含葡萄糖(glucose)，甘露糖(mannose),β-谷甾醇(β-sitosterol)，棕榈酸(palmitic acid)。维生素(vitamin)C，十九烷(nonadecane)，24-乙基胆甾醇(24-ethyl cholesterol)。根皮含锌、锰、铁、铬等23种元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ebli843","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ebli843","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-bwkp27d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-bwkp27d","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.增加体重及抗疲劳作用：选用体重16-18g，雄性昆明种小白鼠，按体重配对分为4组，空白组每日用蒸馏水20ml/kg灌胃，给药组灌胃巴戟天水煎剂20ml/kg，连续给药ll天，实验前各组加服药1次。游泳试验每次放入5只小鼠，实验前称重并按实际重量的5%负重。结果表明，巴戟天能显着增加小鼠体重，延长持续游泳时间。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-j8zj4gu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-j8zj4gu","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对免疫功能的影响：用未成年小白鼠，按ACTH生物活性检定法试验，共享药4天，结果表明，巴戟天温浸剂65g/(kg.d)，80g/(kg.d)口服及巴戟天50%乙醇提取物60g/(kg.d)口服，能使小鼠胸腺萎缩(P值分别为P\u003c0.05，p\u003c0.001，p\u003c0.001)，巴戟天温浸剂10g/(kg.d)腹腔注射，胸腺萎缩亦非常显着(P\u003c0.001)。按乔智胜报道的方法，取出生2l天的昆明种小白鼠，雌雄兼用，按体重配对分血，阳性对照组每日每鼠以0.2%(g/ml)的维生素B4溶液0.6ml灌胃，用药组分别给予巴戟天水煎剂，连续用药10天，最后1次给药后24小时称取体重，尾尖取血，计数白细胞数，并处死动物，分取胸腺称重，结果亦证明巴戟天具有抑制小鼠胸腺萎缩及增加其血中白细胞数的功能。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-vk0pjfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-vk0pjfj","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.对附性器官的影响：巴戟天粗提取物给大鼠或小鼠口服连续14-15天，没有同化作用(以体重、提肛肌或海绵球肌的重量或小鼠肾脏重量增加作为指标)，也未表现有雄性素样作用(以精囊重量增加作为指标)。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-lilqkzx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-lilqkzx","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.皮质酮分泌促进作用：使用体重约35g的ICR雄性小鼠，按Diamondstone方法测定血中皮质酮量，口服给予巴戟天水提取物(1g/kg)，结果糖皮质激素酶标记酶肝AIP活性显着上升，腹腔注射亦呈现较多的TAT(酪氨酸转氨酶)活性，表明巴戟天提取物具有增加血中皮质酮含量的作用，其活性可能是由于下垂体一肾上腺皮质系统受到刺激作用所致。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-0pg3w60","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-0pg3w60","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.降压作用：同属植物Morinda lucida的提取物对麻醉猫有显着降压作用，对不麻醉大鼠也有降压作用，但维持时间短，并有一些安定与利尿作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-plgy9ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-plgy9ic","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.抗炎作用：温浸液50、60g/kg灌胃或10g/kg腹腔注射，对大鼠塑料环肉芽肿有抑制作用；温浸液25、50g/Kg灌胃，不能延长去肾上腺幼年大鼠的存活时间；温浸液350mg/kg灌胃，无增加去肾上腺饥饿小鼠肝糖原累积量的作用，表明巴戟天可能具有肾上肾皮质激素样作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-who474o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-who474o","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-jf7h8ud","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-jf7h8ud","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.巴戟天：拣去杂质，用热水泡透后，趁热抽去木心，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ioi9vyw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ioi9vyw","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.炙巴戟：取甘草，捣碎，置锅内加水煎汤，捞去甘草渣，加入拣净的巴戟天，煮至松软能抽出木心时(此时余汤不宜多)，取出，趁热抽去木心，晒干。(每巴戟天100斤，用甘草6斤4两)3.盐巴戟：取拣净的巴戟天，用盐水拌匀，入笼蒸透，抽去木心，晒干。(每巴戟天100斤，用盐2斤，加适量开水化开澄清)4.使用巴戟天时，须用拘杞子汤浸一宿，至稍软漉出，再用酒浸一伏，再漉出，用菊花一同熬至焦黄，除去菊花，用布拭干用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-w4b4ekd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-w4b4ekd","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.用酒浸一宿，锉焙入药，如急用，只用温水浸软抽去木心用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-uekcpfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-uekcpfm","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ept2z2f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ept2z2f","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝；肾经"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-yl16y1t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-yl16y1t","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-7w5s02p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-7w5s02p","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 辛甘；温"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-bqyv60w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-bqyv60w","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-uszsd4c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-uszsd4c","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 阴虚火旺者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ifsdral","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ifsdral","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-p1xy48h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-p1xy48h","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾助阳；强筋壮骨；祛风除湿。主肾虚阳痿；遗精早泄；少腹冷痛；小便不禁；宫冷不孕；风寒湿痹；腰膝酸软；风湿肢气"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-7o9nejr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-7o9nejr","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-6ypkt9j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-6ypkt9j","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，6-15g；或入丸、散；亦可浸酒或熬膏。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-lnr3g0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-lnr3g0d","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-eahlw04","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-eahlw04","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 赞育丹《景岳全书》：补肾壮阳。毓麟丸《经验方》：男子不育、女子不孕。苁蓉补虚益气方《备急千金方》：五脏虚劳；金刚丸《张氏医通》：肾虚肾痿"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-9yl4fuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-9yl4fuk","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-bw19tk9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-bw19tk9","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本草经疏》：巴戟天，主大风邪气，及头面游风者，风力阳邪，势多走上，《经》曰，邪之所凑，其气必虚，巴戟天性能补助元阳，而兼散邪，况真元得补，邪安所留，此所以愈大风邪气也。主阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中增志益气者，是脾、肾二经得所养，而诸虚自愈矣。其能疗少腹及阴中引痛，下气，并补五劳，益精，利男子者，五脏之劳，肾为之主，下气则火降，火降则水升，阴阳互宅，精神内守，故主肾气滋长，元阳益盛，诸虚为病者，不求其退而退矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-ofdji2p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-ofdji2p","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草汇》：巴戟天，为肾经血分之药，盖补助元阳则胃气滋长，诸虚自退，其功可居萆薢、石斛之上。但其性多热，同黄柏、知母则强阴，同苁蓉、锁阳则助阳，贵乎用之之人用热远热，用寒远寒耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-dyhcu21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-dyhcu21","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《本草新编》：夫命门火衰，则脾胃寒虚，即不能大进饮食，用附子、肉桂以温命门，未免过于太热，何如用巴戟天之甘温，补其火而又不烁其水之为妙耶？或问巴戟天近人止用于丸散之中，不识亦可用于汤剂中耶？曰：巴戟天正汤剂之妙药，温而不热，健脾开胃，既益元阳，复填阴水，真接续之利器，有近效而又有速功。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-mk0beiq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-mk0beiq","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《本草求真》：巴戟天，据书称为补肾要剂，能治五痨七伤，强阴益精，以其体润故耳。然气味辛温，又能祛风除湿，故凡腰膝疼痛，风气脚气水肿等症，服之更为有益。观守真地黄饮子，用此以治风邪，义实基此，未可专作补阴论也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-5l9gtai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-5l9gtai","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本经》：主大风邪气，阴痿不起，强筋骨，安五脏，补中增志益气。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-bi2zkvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-bi2zkvs","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《别录》：疗头面游风，小腹及阴中相引痛，下气，补五劳，益精。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-uj7gd3u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-uj7gd3u","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《药性论》：治男子梦交泄精，强阴，除头面中风，主下气，大风血癞。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-p8tncf9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-p8tncf9","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《日华子本草》：安五脏，定心气，除一切风。疗水肿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-4wboj49","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-4wboj49","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《纲目》：治脚气，去风疾，补血海。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-nxvs7zl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-nxvs7zl","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草求原》：化痰，治嗽喘，眩晕，泄泻，食少。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-zwqeitq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-zwqeitq","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.广州部队《常用中草药手册》：补肾壮阳，强筋骨，祛风湿，治肾虚腰脚无力，痿痹瘫痪，风湿骨痛，神经衰弱，阳萎遗精，早泄，失眠；妇女不育。"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-dkznk7i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-dkznk7i","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607111046-9tqsomu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111046-9tqsomu","updated":"20240607111046"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607111047-98tr8ug","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607111047-98tr8ug"}},{"ID":"20240607111048-bprauoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607111048-bprauoh"}}]}